  "description": "The Nord 4 features an incredible 2000mAh internal battery, ensuring all day use and longevity. That mighty battery supports a maximum power output of 80W, which when paired with Smok’s sub-ohm RPM 2 and RPM coils (included) delivers unprecedented cloud and flavour production in a compact device that still fits smoothly and discreetly into any pocket or compartment. Smok’s innovative tech makes the Nord 4 replete with useful features including Pod and Coil Detection, Short Circuit Protection, 8-second Cut Off and Low Voltage Protection. Type C charging allows for incredibly fast 1.4A charging with the included cable. The Nord 4 offers the choice of two refillable 2ml pods. The RPM pod is compatible with Smok’s entire range of Smok’s RPM coils while the RPM2 pod and compatible RPM2 coils provide pin-sharp flavour. The Nord 4 kit contains an RPM pod and an RPM 0.4 Ohm coil for an intense mouth-to-lung experience while the RPM 2 pod and 0.16 Ohm mesh coil produces an unbeatable direct lung vape. New to the Nord 4 is a ingenius airflow ring; a discreet wheel below the pod that allows you to rotate freely until you find the perfect draw for you. To refill the pods, you simply pull out the rubber plug, top up with eliquid, reseal the plug and insert the pod back into the device, where it is held firmly with strong magnets. As with previous Nord kits, the Nord 4 displays all the information you need on a crystal-clear OLED screen. Tactile buttons allow you to adjust functions and wattage on the fly. With its immense 80w battery and innovative airflow wheel, the Nord 4 is the most powerful and versatile Nord Pod Mod kit yet, while it still features that unmistakably sleek and compact Nord look. Explore our vaping juice UK and discover the ideal match for this kit.",
